1. EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This project is a high-end, luxury interior architecture and interior design 
portfolio web application. It combines cutting-edge interactive scrollytelling 
with a responsive commercial studio showcase.

Key Highlights:
- 300-Frame Interactive Canvas Intro: An Apple-style scrollytelling intro sequence 
  rendered on an HTML5 high-DPI canvas that scrubs frame-by-frame as the user scrolls, 
  with dynamic editorial story beats and an ambient HUD.
- Seamless Docking Morph Transition: Once all 300 frames are completed (or skipped), 
  the full-screen intro canvas physically scales and docks directly into the CAD 
  architectural carousel of the Hero section below.
- Dual-Mode Adaptive Navbar: Floats as a top horizontal luxury pill when at the page top, 
  and automatically transforms into a left-aligned vertical floating icon dock once 
  scrolled past 70% of the viewport height.
- Three-Tier Depth Dark/Light Theme Engine: Full support for both luxury warm ivory 
  light mode and a three-tier depth dark mode (base background, alternating section 
  tier, and elevated cards/modals surface tier with terracotta and brass accents).
- Interactive Cost Estimator: A slide-up consultation modal calculating real-time 
  interior renovation and architectural budgets based on category, finish tier, 
  square footage, and project scope percentage.
- Bespoke Brand Identity: Powered by the custom golden architectural monogram logo 
  (Bhaiya.svg and Bhaiya.png), integrated across the navbar, HUD, stamps, seals, 
  portfolio cards, estimate headers, and browser favicon.

